Review record for the 0.1.1 patch release.

Five independent agents read bd42a12, the commit one step behind this
one. Three returned PASS: review-docs, review-deps, review-usability.
Two returned FAIL, and both findings are fixed in e34a61d: a directory
name holding a line break wrote two records from one grant, and the
guard against the false security claim read the four prose pages and
not the binary's own help text.

The driver verified e34a61d directly and signs off on that basis. Each
line below states what was run. Where an independent agent's finding is
carried, it is named.

